{"level":"debug","time":"2026-09-09T16:09:51Z","caller":"/home/agentsentinel/test/agent-sentinel/handler/handler.go:602","message":"handler: accept tool use message: [%!q(*audit.ToolUseMessage=&{user Tool Use Results:\nPillow installed}) %!q(*audit.ToolUseMessage=&{ai_agent Tool Use: bash\nTool Description:A tool that allows the agent to run bash commands. Importantly, it will launch a bash process or use existed bash process, then send the bash commands to the bash process.\nTool Input: {'command': 'python3 << \\'EOF\\'\\nfrom PIL import Image\\nfrom PIL.ExifTags import TAGS\\n\\n# Open the image\\nimg = Image.open(\\'/tmp/test.jpeg\\')\\n\\n# Get EXIF data\\nexif_data = img._getexif()\\n\\nif exif_data:\\n    for tag_id, value in exif_data.items():\\n        tag_name = TAGS.get(tag_id, tag_id)\\n        if tag_name == \"ImageDescription\":\\n            print(f\"ImageDescription: {value}\")\\n            break\\n    else:\\n        print(\"ImageDescription tag not found in EXIF data\")\\nelse:\\n    print(\"No EXIF data found in image\")\\nEOF\\n'}})]"}
